<Base title="About VisaOS | Editorial Standards" description="Learn about VisaOS, its independent status and commitment to source-backed visa information."><div class="wrap article"><h1>About VisaOS</h1><p>VisaOS is an independent educational project aiming to make U.S. visa information easier to find and understand. We are not affiliated with the United States government, embassies, consulates, or visa scheduling providers.</p><h2>Editorial standards</h2><p>Changing policy claims should link to the relevant official source and be reviewed for applicable country, category, conditions, and date. We do not guarantee visa issuance or provide legal representation.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>We publish corrections through reviewed repository changes. Do not post personal passport, application, or financial details in public GitHub issues.</p></div></Base>